sequenceDiagram
    participant OS as Operating System
    participant EB as Ebitengine
    participant BE as pixelforge_ebiten
    participant Core as pixelforge Core
    participant Input as Input Subsystems
    participant Audio as pixelforge_audio
    participant User as User Game Code

    OS->>EB: OS Timer Tick 60 TPS
    EB->>BE: Update() called
    BE->>Core: Publish EventFrameStart
    BE->>Input: Poll keyboard-mouse-gamepad
    Input->>Core: Publish key-mouse-pad events
    BE->>Core: Publish EventUpdate
    User->>Core: Update() logic user-defined
    User->>Core: SetPixel-DrawSprite etc
    BE->>Core: Publish EventDraw
    User->>Core: Draw() logic user-defined
    Core->>Core: Apply color tables-masks-clipping
    Core->>BE: Return modified Canvas
    BE->>EB: CopyCanvasToEbitenImage()
    EB->>OS: GPU Compositing Swap buffers
    BE->>Audio: Audio callback 44100 Hz
    Audio->>Audio: Mix 4 channels to stereo PCM
